    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Ramnath,<div><br></div><div>Thank you very much for your comment. I considered your suggestion. However, I am still confused. Here is scripts from the Shiny Text example.</div><div><br></div><div>ui.R</div><div><br></div><div><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99\">library(<span style=\"color:#000000\">shiny</span>)</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99;min-height:19.0px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#4f4f4f\"># Define UI for dateset viewer application</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99;min-height:19.0px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99\">shinyUI(pageWithSidebar(</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99;min-height:19.0px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span>headerPanel(<span style=\"color:#b0130a\">&quot;Shiny Text&quot;</span>),</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99;min-height:19.0px\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span>sidebarPanel(</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#b0130a\"><span style=\"color:#0e1f99\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t\t</span>selectInput(</span>&quot;dataset&quot;<span style=\"color:#0e1f99\">, </span>&quot;Choose a dataset:&quot;<span style=\"color:#0e1f99\">,</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#b0130a\"><span style=\"color:#0e1f99\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\">choices</span><span style=\"color:#0e1f99\"> = c(</span>&quot;foo&quot;<span style=\"color:#0e1f99\">, </span>&quot;Pressure&quot;<span style=\"color:#0e1f99\">, </span>&quot;Cars&quot;<span style=\"color:#0e1f99\">)),</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99;min-height:19.0px\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t\t</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#b0130a\"><span style=\"color:#0e1f99\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t\t</span>numericInput(</span>&quot;obs&quot;<span style=\"color:#0e1f99\">, </span>&quot;Number of observations to view:&quot;<span style=\"color:#0e1f99\">, </span><span style=\"color:#055218\">10</span><span style=\"color:#0e1f99\">)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99;min-height:19.0px\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t\t</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>),</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99;min-height:19.0px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span>mainPanel(</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t\t</span>verbatimTextOutput(<span style=\"color:#b0130a\">&quot;summary&quot;</span>),</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99;min-height:19.0px\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t\t</span>tableOutput(<span style=\"color:#b0130a\">&quot;view&quot;</span>)</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99;min-height:19.0px\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span>)</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span>))</p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99\">server.R looks like this.</p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99\"></p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99\">library(<span style=\"color:#000000\">shiny</span>)</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99\">library(<span style=\"color:#000000\">datasets</span>)</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99;min-height:19.0px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99\">shinyServer(<span style=\"color:#c38928\">function</span>(<span style=\"color:#000000\">input</span>, <span style=\"color:#000000\">output</span>) {</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99;min-height:19.0px\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span><span style=\"color:#000000\">datasetInput</span> &lt;- reactive({</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99;min-height:19.0px\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#4f4f4f\"><span style=\"color:#0e1f99\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span></span># Return the requested dataset</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier\"><span style=\"color:#0e1f99\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span>switch(</span>input<span style=\"color:#0e1f99\">$</span>dataset<span style=\"color:#0e1f99\">,</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t\t</span><span style=\"color:#b0130a\">&quot;foo&quot;</span> = <span style=\"color:#000000\">rock</span>,</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#b0130a\"><span style=\"color:#0e1f99\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t\t</span></span>&quot;Pressure&quot;<span style=\"color:#0e1f99\"> = </span><span style=\"color:#000000\">pressure</span><span style=\"color:#0e1f99\">,</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t\t</span><span style=\"color:#b0130a\">&quot;Cars&quot;</span> = <span style=\"color:#000000\">cars</span>)</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>})</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99;min-height:19.0px\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#4f4f4f\"><span style=\"color:#0e1f99\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span></span># Generate a summary of the dataset</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span><span style=\"color:#000000\">output</span>$<span style=\"color:#000000\">summary</span> &lt;- renderPrint({</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span><span style=\"color:#000000\">dataset</span> &lt;- datasetInput()</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span>summary(<span style=\"color:#000000\">dataset</span>)</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>})</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99;min-height:19.0px\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#4f4f4f\"><span style=\"color:#0e1f99\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span></span># Show the first &quot;n&quot; observations</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span><span style=\"color:#000000\">output</span>$<span style=\"color:#000000\">view</span> &lt;- renderTable({</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span>head(datasetInput(), <span style=\"color:#000000\">n</span> = <span style=\"color:#000000\">input</span>$<span style=\"color:#000000\">obs</span>)</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>})</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99\">})</p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99\">These two scripts work fine. When you choose &quot;foo&quot;, the server knows it needs to use the rock</p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99\">dataset. In my case, you choose &quot;Paris Charles De Gaulle&quot;, and I assume that the server knows</p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99\">it needs to use the dataset, paris. I think I am following the logic from the Shiny Text example. The cause(s) of my issue exist(s) in other places in my scripts.</p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99\">One thing I corrected in my server.R is the following. I had graphdata() in ggplot(). I changed that to graphdata in ggplot().</p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99\"></p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier\"><span style=\"color:#0e1f99\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span></span><span style=\"color:#c38928\">if</span><span style=\"color:#0e1f99\">(</span>input<span style=\"color:#0e1f99\">$</span>dataset<span style=\"color:#0e1f99\"> == </span><span style=\"color:#b0130a\">&quot;berlin&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#0e1f99\">){</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99;min-height:19.0px\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t\t</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier\"><span style=\"color:#0e1f99\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t\t</span></span>theGraph<span style=\"color:#0e1f99\"> &lt;- ggplot(</span>graphdata<span style=\"color:#0e1f99\">, aes(</span>shortdate<span style=\"color:#0e1f99\">, </span>mean_C<span style=\"color:#0e1f99\">)) +</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>geom_line() +</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>scale_x_date(<span style=\"color:#000000\">labels</span> = date_format(<span style=\"color:#b0130a\">&quot;%Y-%m-%d&quot;</span>)) +</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>xlab(<span style=\"color:#b0130a\">&quot;&quot;</span>) +</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#b0130a\"><span style=\"color:#0e1f99\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>ylab(</span>&quot;Mean Temperature (C)&quot;<span style=\"color:#0e1f99\">) +</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#b0130a\"><span style=\"color:#0e1f99\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>ggtitle(</span>&quot;2013 Average Daily Temperature in Berlin&quot;<span style=\"color:#0e1f99\">)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span>}</p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99\"><br></p><p></p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99\">I guess my issue is trivial from the perspective of programmers. I am doing my best to make this application work. If anybody can suggest anything, that would be very helpful. Thank you very much for your attention and support.</p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:16.0px Courier;color:#0e1f99\"><br></p><p></p><br></div></div>"
    ]
